row
  col
    h1 Python 3.15.0 documentation
    text Welcome! This is the official documentation for Python 3.15.0.
    text Documentation sections:
    row
      col
        link "What's new in Python 3.15?" whatsnew/3.15.html
        link "all \"What's new\" documents since Python 2.0" whatsnew/index.html
        link Tutorial tutorial/index.html
        text Start here: a tour of Python's syntax and features
        link "Built-ins reference" builtins/index.html
        text Built-in functions and classes
        link "Library reference" library/index.html
        text Standard library modules
        link "Language reference" reference/index.html
        text Syntax and language elements
        link "Python setup and usage" using/index.html
        text How to install, configure, and use Python
      col
        link "Python HOWTOs" howto/index.html
        text In-depth topic manuals
        link "Installing Python modules" installing/index.html
        text Third-party modules and PyPI.org
        link "Extending and embedding" extending/index.html
        text For C/C++ programmers
        link "Python's C API" c-api/index.html
        text C API reference
        link FAQs faq/index.html
        text Frequently asked questions (with answers!)
        link Deprecations deprecations/index.html
        text Deprecated functionality
    text Other resources:
    row
      col
        link "Python developer's guide" https://devguide.python.org
        text Information on contributing to Python
        link "Python Packaging User Guide" https://packaging.python.org
        text Resources relating to Python packaging
        link "Audio/visual talks" https://www.python.org/doc/av/
        text Podcasts, talks, and video presentations from the community
      col
        link "Python Enhancement Proposals" https://peps.python.org/
        text Index of proposed improvements to Python
        link "Static Typing with Python" https://typing.python.org
        text Information and guides about Python type safety
    text Indices, glossary, and search:
    row
      col
        link "Global module index" py-modindex.html
        text All modules and libraries
        link "General index" genindex.html
        text All functions, classes, and terms
        link Glossary glossary.html
        text Terms explained
      col
        link "Search page" search.html
        text Search this documentation
        link "Complete table of contents" contents.html
        text All sections and subsections
    text Project information:
    row
      col
        link "Reporting issues" bugs.html
        link "Contributing to docs" https://devguide.python.org/documentation/help-documenting/
        link "Download the documentation" download.html
      col
        link "History and license of Python" license.html
        link Copyright copyright.html
        link "About the documentation" about.html
